\left\{\ \cdot\ \right\} \cpar \mathopen{\forall x.}\left(R \cpar \left(U\wwith \left(V \cpar W\right)\right)\right)
}{
\left\{\ \cdot\ \right\} \cpar \mathopen{\forall x.}\left(\left(R \cpar U\right) \wwith \left(R \cpar V \cpar W\right)\right)
}}
\]

\[
