 U_i
}}
$ holds.

Similarly, by Lemma~\ref{lemma:split-times}, there exist $W_i$ and $\hat{W}_i$ such that $\vdash Q\sub{x}{y}\mathclose\sigma \cpar \hat{W}_i$ and either $W_i = \hat{W}_i$ or $W_i = \wen y. \hat{W}_i$, and also the derivation 
$
